    "The dominant source of delay across most airports is weather, represented in grey, followed closely by aerodrome capacity (green) and ATC-related causes such as ATC capacity and ATC staffing. These patterns are consistent with broader air traffic flow management (ATFM) issues, where delays are largely due to constraints in airspace and airport capacity rather than airline or passenger factors.\n",
